src/go_bcrypt.rs adapts golang.org/x/crypto v0.53.0 bcrypt/bcrypt.go and
bcrypt/base64.go, plus Go 1.26.9 encoding/base64/base64.go decodeQuantum.
It uses the existing bcrypt 0.16.0 and blowfish 0.9.1 backend primitives,
including the Rust bcrypt key-schedule/encryption reference for shorter Go
salts. Constant-time comparison uses the existing subtle 2.6.1 implementation.
Original BSD/MIT terms are retained in LICENSE-GO-CRYPTO, LICENSE-GO-STDLIB and
LICENSE-BCRYPT. No dependency version update was made.

